  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gan inn emfela manna of ægðre healfe, and standen on twa healfe þæs órdales andlang þære cyricean, and þa beon ealle fæstende and fram heora wífe gehealdene þære nyhte;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And [then] an equal number of men from each party shall enter, and stand along the church on both sides of the ordeal, and all these shall be fasting and shall have abstained from their wives during the night;</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 gan inn emfela manna of ægðre healfe 7 stande[n] on twa healfe þæs órdales andlang þære cyricean; 7 þa beon ealle fæstende 7 fram heora wífe gehealdene þære nyhte.</ab>
      </div>
